    {
      "version": "1.1",
      "releaseNotes": "More ways to play on your wrist!\n\n• New games: Dive Snake, Sand Blocks and Spider Solitaire.\n• Dive Snake: explore five times the playable area with a camera that follows your snake.\n• Space Walk: enjoy a counter-rotating ring, sliding footsteps and smooth transitions between the inner and outer lanes.\n• Little Fire Dragon: collect coins and celebrate each successful obstacle pass with a blink.\n• Brick Breaker: uncover hidden rewards, including a wider paddle, slower ball and bonus points.\n• Cleaner screens with fewer badges and clearer score displays.",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-19T21:29:32Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.2",
      "releaseNotes": "Introducing Cat Basketball for Apple Watch!\n\nHold to charge, release to shoot, and use the trajectory preview to guide each shot into the hoop.\n\n• Challenge 12 levels with different platform obstacles and hoop positions.\n• Get five shots per level. Make a basket to unlock the next challenge.\n• Enjoy a playful cat, seaside sunsets and colorful cartoon artwork.\n• Jump in from the Home recommendation. Unlocked levels are saved on your watch.\n\nTurn a short break into a fun basketball challenge!",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-20T21:52:11Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "Cat Basketball brings new challenges to your wrist!\n- Explore 32 levels with 1–6 obstacles each and varied layouts.\n- Take on progressively narrower hoops that reward precise charge control.\n- Enjoy expressive cat animations: effort while charging, a blink after each shot, a happy tail wag when you score, and disappointment after a miss.\n- Watch the rim react to impacts and the net stretch and bounce as the ball drops through.\nHold to charge and release to shoot. Five shots per level—one basket clears it!",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-23T07:57:45Z"
